\pi ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, if $cot⁡x=-4,$ then $cot⁡(x+17\\pi )=-4.$\n\nFinally, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3cot⁡(x+7\\pi )+6 & =3(-4)+6 \\\\  & =-12+6 \\\\  & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-103838/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d02418c3-4c04-57b8-8f10-18858b1759ab"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-103838"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103840/selection/af5580a233ee3709064249d6732fc822dfb93f38caf90c025deb51b127e90b2c" :answer/id #uuid "dbd8210e-432f-5628-84f3-b75eecf78ce2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103840/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "075b92fc-62d2-5972-8698-021a9deab6de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103840/selection/5766dd95366514a2009c187bf6db234b5590f18834cf7769f03e77b5a5218b8e" :answer/id #uuid "cb154967-200b-5d5b-ba5e-fb9baf60dd57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\pi -\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103840/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d" :answer/id #uuid "3ca13301-f322-5966-8c1b-376a73243ee1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103840/selection/73cd213ba4d0f454d3e20ed7e2da204058e1db7d52606534b68502d61db8b80d" :answer/id #uuid "1e1efcc5-b35d-570f-8b89-5ff3d3695003" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}-2\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103840/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9f5f1f24-472b-58a2-9257-623454bbfa2d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-103840/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d" :answer-field/choices ["q-103840/selection/af55