]} {:db/id "q-66675" :question/id #uuid "d4e0627c-7ad9-5c01-b554-599190d7bd8d" :question/math-academy-id "q-66675" :question/is-example false :question/problem "If $cot⁡x=\\sqrt{3}$ for some $x$, then find the value of $\\sqrt{3}cot⁡(x-\\pi )-4.$" :question/worked-solution "The period of $y=cot⁡x$ is $\\pi .$ Therefore, for integer $n$ we have\n\n$$\ncot⁡x=cot⁡(x+n\\pi ).\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=-1$ into the right-hand-side of the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}cot⁡x=cot⁡(x+(-1)\\cdot \\pi )=cot⁡(x-\\pi ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, if $cot⁡x=\\sqrt{3},$ then $cot⁡(x-\\pi )=\\sqrt{3}.$\n\nFinally, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3}cot⁡(x-\\pi )-4 & =\\sqrt{3}(\\sqrt{3})-4 \\\\  & ={(\\sqrt{3})}^{2}-4 \\\\  & =3-4 \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-66675/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d02418c3-4c04-57b8-8f10-18858b1759ab"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-66675"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103839/selection/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" :answer/id #uuid "ab6ed830-864a-5ce7-bfd6-40421cddf26f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103839/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "5e97bfef-6bd5-5095-9063-7aeb18e6d44b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103839/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "9b1e0cc8-3b2e-57c9-93e5-a470cdc964a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103839/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "edbebaf8-ee68-573f-9f56-efaadee04c00" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103839/selection